No, no, no, no, but even with the mind and so on. So, like appearance even, somebody.

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:54.260
Ugly, sickly. But the point is this, take a pure shura. No, no, no. Siliha. A person is ugly. A person is ugly. Yes?

00:01:54.260 --> 00:02:04.260
And a person is beautiful. No, one second. Just that a person is ugly. And a person is handsome.

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:12.260
