00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:34.012
No matter how ugly a person is and no matter how this and so on I once had the most horrible situation in my life Well I mean horrible since I personally felt very bad

00:02:36.012 --> 00:02:50.012
Somebody happened this to me about six, seven years ago in Beit Tora. I cannot mention the name of the family, but a beautiful boy, crippled, but you could see his face, he had a beautiful face,

00:02:50.012 --> 00:03:01.012
Went up to Sefer Tora because of Bar misva. He hardly could walk to the Sefer Tora. It was like a horrible, horrible, horrible, horrible thing.

00:03:01.012 --> 00:03:12.012
You see how the boy was struggling to climb up to the Tevah. He went up. And as the guy went up, somebody, I don't want to say anything, said to him,

00:03:12.012 --> 00:03:20.012
Why God made this guy, this person? Why did he make him?

00:03:20.012 --> 00:03:29.012
